{"id":"544534f7ba36ba34","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure.md","title":"本原递归函数的最小闭包","display":"thm-primitive-recursive-closure — 本原递归函数的最小闭包","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure","aliases":["18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure"],"display":"thm-primitive-recursive-closure — 本原递归函数的最小闭包","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","[[18-df-function-composition]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"Theorem 2.1.4","source_printed_pages":"10–11","source_pdf_pages":"21–22","source_correspondence":"closure-and-minimality-with-explicit-arity","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-primitive-recursive-closure — 本原递归函数的最小闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c238813071f77433\" href=\"?note=c238813071f77433\" title=\"18-df-function-composition\">18-df-function-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 2.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"10–11"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"21–22"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"closure-and-minimality-with-explicit-arity"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k,i,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k,i,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n,\\operatorname{ev},S,C_k^n,P_i^n,\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n,\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n,\\operatorname{ev},S,C_k^n,P_i^n,\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n,\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c238813071f77433\" href=\"?note=c238813071f77433\" title=\"18-df-function-composition\">18-df-function-composition</a>。函数项构造与外延函数分属不同对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat t\">\\(\\widehat t\\)</span> 是下式引入的函数图。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为所有有限元数的全数论函数组成的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n\">\\(\\mathcal F_n\\)</span> 表示该族的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元部分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRClosed}\\)</span> 由下式定义。复合中的元组按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\ldots,m\">\\(1,\\ldots,m\\)</span> 编号，递归中的数值参数依次为阶段、前值、其余参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat t\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec z,\\operatorname{ev}(t,\\vec z)\\rangle:\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat t\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec z,\\operatorname{ev}(t,\\vec z)\\rangle:\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\widehat S\\in\\mathcal F_1\n\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\widehat{C_k^n}\\in\\mathcal F_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(\\widehat{P_i^n}\\in\\mathcal F_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\ge1\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;\n\\forall\\vec H\\in(\\mathcal F_n)^m\\;\n\\operatorname{Comp}(G,H_1,\\ldots,H_m)\\in\\mathcal F_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_n\\;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\;\n\\exists K\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\;\\forall\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\Bigl(\nK(0,\\vec z)=G(\\vec z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nK(k+1,\\vec z)=H(k,K(k,\\vec z),\\vec z)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\widehat S\\in\\mathcal F_1\n\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\widehat{C_k^n}\\in\\mathcal F_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(\\widehat{P_i^n}\\in\\mathcal F_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\ge1\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;\n\\forall\\vec H\\in(\\mathcal F_n)^m\\;\n\\operatorname{Comp}(G,H_1,\\ldots,H_m)\\in\\mathcal F_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_n\\;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\;\n\\exists K\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\;\\forall\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\Bigl(\nK(0,\\vec z)=G(\\vec z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nK(k+1,\\vec z)=H(k,K(k,\\vec z),\\vec z)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathrm{PR}^{18})\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\to\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathrm{PR}^{18})\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\to\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已逐段阅读 Theorem 2.1.4 的证明。基本函数由基本项求值获得；复合由 Sub 项求值获得；递归由 Rec 项求值获得，其中对阶段作自然数归纳核对方程。任意满足闭包条件的族都包含每个函数项的求值：对项构造作结构归纳，Sub 情形用复合闭包，Rec 情形用自然数递归的唯一性和递归闭包。因此得到最小性。</p>\n<p>本节点补出原有函数项定义与函数复合定义未单列的外延闭包定理。搜索范围为本目录全部原子及 glossary；004 只定义 Comp，primitive-recursive-terms 只构造项与求值，均不能替代这里的最小性断言。零元常函数沿用本书现有约定；未引入无界最小化闭包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primi