hbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^n}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat t\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec z,\\operatorname{ev}(t,\\vec z)\\rangle:\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\widehat S\\in\\mathcal F_1\n\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\widehat{C_k^n}\\in\\mathcal F_n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(\\widehat{P_i^n}\\in\\mathcal F_n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\ge1\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;\n\\forall\\vec H\\in(\\mathcal F_n)^m\\;\n\\operatorname{Comp}(G,H_1,\\ldots,H_m)\\in\\mathcal F_n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_n\\;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\;\n\\exists K\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\;\\forall\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\Bigl(\nK(0,\\vec z)=G(\\vec z)\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nK(k+1,\\vec z)=H(k,K(k,\\vec z),\\vec z)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathrm{PR}^{18})\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\to\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":3362,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure]]"},{"id":"88497c28c97d78b7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$m\\ge1$，$R,S\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_n$，$P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}$，$Q\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_m$；$\\mathrm{PRPred}$ 及特征函数约定见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]。$g_1,\\ldots,g_m\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n$；函数闭包见 [[18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-primitive-recursive-closure]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23"